<view class="page safe-bottom" style="{{themeStyle}}"><view class="page-intro"><text class="eyebrow">RESCHEDULE</text><view class="page-title">选择新的上门时间</view><view class="muted">原预约会保留到新时段确认成功，避免改期失败后丢失预约。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">服务日期</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="date-scroll"><view class="chip-wrap single-line"><view wx:for="{{dates}}" wx:key="value" class="chip {{date===item.value?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="chooseDate">{{item.label}}</view></view></scroll-view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{slots.length}}"><view class="section-title">可约时间</view><view class="chip-wrap"><view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{slot===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseSlot">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="card empty-inline" wx:elif="{{loading}}"><view class="muted">正在查询可约时间…</view></view><view class="card empty-inline" wx:else><view class="section-title">当天已约满</view><view class="muted">请切换其他日期，我们只展示当前真实可预约时段。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">改期原因</view><view class="input-card"><textarea class="textarea-field" value="{{reason}}" maxlength="500" bindinput="inputReason" /></view></view><view class="bottom-bar"><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{loading || submitting || !slot}}" bindtap="submit">确认改期</button></view></view>
